{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is in a state of unrefined chaos. As Beatrix, you have been summoned to the <strong>Circles of Hell</strong> to uncover an anomaly rotting the afterlife. To restore order\u2014or dismantle it entirely\u2014you must master the <strong>Psychomachia</strong> (&quot;battle of the soul&quot;), craft a lethal build of <strong>Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;)\u2014powerful effects that alter your battlefield\u2014and survive a descent into the frozen heart of Treachery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/6d84aa0e11ee1ad0686d185c96596d60.poster.avif?t=1774433406\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/6d84aa0e11ee1ad0686d185c96596d60.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/6d84aa0e11ee1ad0686d185c96596d60.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/030364a16edcf9aa045e2e14517812b5.avif?t=1774433406\" width=800 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/70ad67704842cec08ffcc7b7e1e79f15.poster.avif?t=1774433406\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/70ad67704842cec08ffcc7b7e1e79f15.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/70ad67704842cec08ffcc7b7e1e79f15.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance traditional deckbuilding with the <strong>Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;) System, a deep board-build strategy. <strong>Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;) are persistent effects deployed at the start of battle to redefine how the board functions. By selecting a starting <strong>Genius</strong> archetype and collecting rare <strong>Reliquiae</strong> (&quot;Relics&quot;), you can layer these effects to trigger massive chain reactions. Whether you're enhancing card values or automating <strong>Regiones</strong> (&quot;Regions&quot;) conquest, success depends on your ability to build a board-wide strategy that works for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/80e5c2965b914c8c44c98d48039be9c5.avif?t=1774433406\" width=800 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/86a2b737b6c04b68b67ab95a1c58d4de.poster.avif?t=1774433406\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/86a2b737b6c04b68b67ab95a1c58d4de.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/86a2b737b6c04b68b67ab95a1c58d4de.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the spatial logic of <i>Triple Triad</i> and <i>Othello</i>, every card placement is a high-stakes bid for territory. Encircle your enemies horizontally, vertically, or diagonally to initiate a Card Clash, testing your cards\u2019 <strong>Potentia</strong> (&quot;Power&quot;) against the damned and <strong>Custos</strong> (&quot;Guardians&quot;). Win the confrontation to flip enemy units to your side, using their own strength to seize control of the board. A single clever move can turn a crushing defeat into a total takeover of the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/5df93055ca018974ff7bbde9ece9ccaf.avif?t=1774433406\" width=800 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/f7a239c0ea1882eee3d9ba83575006c7.poster.avif?t=1774433406\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/f7a239c0ea1882eee3d9ba83575006c7.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/f7a239c0ea1882eee3d9ba83575006c7.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through the Circles of Hell is a reactive experience where your decisions physically alter your power. Encounter a cast of eerie NPCs and grotesque Bosses rendered in a striking, dark-eerie aesthetic. Upon defeating the <strong>Custos</strong> (&quot;Guardians&quot;) of Hell, you act as judge: your verdicts and your moral convictions dictate the growth of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/c8dfccc130e0621f6ff74f6f47e8641d.avif?t=1774433406\" width=800 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/5bac18f01f5d82e5e09c1965eede6048.poster.avif?t=1774433406\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/5bac18f01f5d82e5e09c1965eede6048.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/5bac18f01f5d82e5e09c1965eede6048.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs through the afterlife are the same. With <strong>22 Major Arcana</strong> cards to power up and over <strong>100 Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;) and <strong>Reliquiae</strong> (&quot;Relics&quot;) to discover, the tactical possibilities are infinite. Navigate through the Circles of Hell, each featuring unique environmental hazards and story-driven encounters that reveal the truth behind the anomaly. Unlock new <strong>Genius</strong> sets, hidden paths, and multiple endings as you refine your mastery over the laws of Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/045299a13fd6fa5859b5e2c7a97b9433.avif?t=1774433406\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=800 height=108 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board-Wide Strategy</strong> \u2014 Enhance your hand with the <strong>Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;) System. Deploy persistent field effects that orchestrate your strategy and redefine the rules of the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positional Combat</strong> \u2014 A high-stakes &quot;Surround and Flip&quot; system that takes inspiration from <i>Triple Triad</i> and <i>Othello</i>. Encircle enemies to trigger a Card Clash, testing your <strong>Potentia</strong> (&quot;Power&quot;) to seize control of their units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Verdict &amp; Growth</strong> \u2014 You are the judge. Defeat the <strong>Custos</strong> (&quot;Guardians&quot;) of Hell and pass sentence to unlock new build possibilities and carve your path through Hell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Starting Archetypes</strong> \u2014 Choose your <strong>Genius</strong> to anchor your run, then layer rare <strong>Reliquiae</strong> (&quot;Relics&quot;), <strong>Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;), and Tarots to create unstoppable chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Replayability</strong> \u2014 With 22 Arcana cards to evolve and 100+ <strong>Canones</strong> and <strong>Reliquiae</strong> to discover, every descent offers a new puzzle in spatial logic and board optimization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Visceral, Reactive Inferno</strong> \u2014 Explore the Circles of Hell in a dark-eerie aesthetic. Navigate story-driven encounters and environmental hazards that lead to multiple narrative endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/31fc03bd40a382e0c21a7cd065995e13.poster.avif?t=1774433406\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/31fc03bd40a382e0c21a7cd065995e13.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/31fc03bd40a382e0c21a7cd065995e13.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054790?t=1774433406","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/875ab4f061151fa47fd6d098f6d6f33a03255732/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774433406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/6a74c65555b73f1d2a26ad9426eb903196089f39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774433406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/6a74c65555b73f1d2a26ad9426eb903196089f39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774433406","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes and symbolic depictions that may be disturbing to some players. It includes references to the seven deadly sins, damnation, and corruption, along with stylized and psychological violence. There are no explicit sexual acts, but themes of lust, faith, and moral judgment are present throughout. The overall tone is dark and may not be suitable for all audiences."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4506560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is in a state of unrefined chaos. As Beatrix, you have been summoned to the <strong>Circles of Hell</strong> to uncover an anomaly rotting the afterlife. To restore order\u2014or dismantle it entirely\u2014you must master the <strong>Psychomachia</strong> (&quot;battle of the soul&quot;), craft a lethal build of <strong>Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&qu