rd functions. By selecting a starting <strong>Genius</strong> archetype and collecting rare <strong>Reliquiae</strong> (&quot;Relics&quot;), you can layer these effects to trigger massive chain reactions. Whether you're enhancing card values or automating <strong>Regiones</strong> (&quot;Regions&quot;) conquest, success depends on your ability to build a board-wide strategy that works for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/80e5c2965b914c8c44c98d48039be9c5.avif?t=1774433406\" width=800 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/86a2b737b6c04b68b67ab95a1c58d4de.poster.avif?t=1774433406\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/86a2b737b6c04b68b67ab95a1c58d4de.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/86a2b737b6c04b68b67ab95a1c58d4de.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the spatial logic of <i>Triple Triad</i> and <i>Othello</i>, every card placement is a high-stakes bid for territory. Encircle your enemies horizontally, vertically, or diagonally to initiate a Card Clash, testing your cards\u2019 <strong>Potentia</strong> (&quot;Power&quot;) against the damned and <strong>Custos</strong> (&quot;Guardians&quot;). Win the confrontation to flip enemy units to your side, using their own strength to seize control of the board. A single clever move can turn a crushing defeat into a total takeover of the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><spa