c18f01f5d82e5e09c1965eede6048.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/5bac18f01f5d82e5e09c1965eede6048.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs through the afterlife are the same. With <strong>22 Major Arcana</strong> cards to power up and over <strong>100 Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;) and <strong>Reliquiae</strong> (&quot;Relics&quot;) to discover, the tactical possibilities are infinite. Navigate through the Circles of Hell, each featuring unique environmental hazards and story-driven encounters that reveal the truth behind the anomaly. Unlock new <strong>Genius</strong> sets, hidden paths, and multiple endings as you refine your mastery over the laws of Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/045299a13fd6fa5859b5e2c7a97b9433.avif?t=1774433406\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=800 height=108 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board-Wide Strategy</strong> \u2014 Enhance your hand with the <strong>Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;) System. Deploy persistent field effects that orchestrate your strategy and redefine the rules of the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positional Combat</strong> \u2014 A high-stakes &quot;Surround and Flip&quot; system that takes inspiration from <i>Triple Triad</i> and <i>Othello</i>. Encircle enemies to trigger a Card Clash, testing your <strong>Potentia</strong> (&quot;Power&quot;) to seize control of their units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Verdict &amp; Growth</strong> \u2014 You are the judge. Defeat the <strong>Custos</strong> (&quot;Guardians&quot;) of Hell and pass sentence to unlock new build possibilities and carve your path through Hell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Starting Archetypes</strong> \u2014 Choose your <strong>Genius</strong> to anchor your run, then layer rare <strong>Reliquiae</strong> (&quot;Relics&quot;), <strong>Canones</strong> (&quot;Canons&quot;), and Tarots to create unstoppable chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Replayability</strong> \u2014 With 22 Arcana cards to evolve and 100+ <strong>Canones</strong> and <strong>Reliquiae</strong> to discover, every descent offers a new puzzle in spatial logic and board optimization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Visceral, Reactive Inferno</strong> \u2014 Explore the Circles of Hell in a dark-eerie aesthetic. Navigate story-driven encounters and environmental hazards that lead to multiple narrative endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/31fc03bd40a382e0c21a7cd065995e13.poster.avif?t=1774433406\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/31fc03bd40a382e0c21a7cd065995e13.webm?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/extras/31fc03bd40a382e0c21a7cd065995e13.mp4?t=1774433406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Tamb\u00f9 Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054790/27c9b8f1f9b56ac73959dca737543dfa130b91c2/header.jpg?t=1774433406","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>